{"title":"TRAVEL","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eFrom the versatile Datum Dahleez Rolltop Backpack, ideal for both urban adventures and weekend getaways, to the stylish Datum Dahleez Duffle Bag for your short trips, each piece embodies the elegance synonymous with the Datum Dahleez name. Accessorize with sophisticated items like the Black Leather Credit Card Holder and Macaron Wallet to keep your essentials organized in style. Don't forget to brave the elements with a chic Datum Dahleez Umbrella or add a touch of sophistication with a Carbon Fibre Pen. Discover the entire collection and travel in style with Datum Dahleez.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","products":[{"product_id":"Datum Dahleez-rolltop-backpack","title":"Datum Dahleez ROLLTOP BACKPACK","description":"\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003eThe Datum Dahleez \"EB\" rolltop backpack in black and blue, boasting the iconic Datum Dahleez logo for the ultimate sleek look. This backpack features inner laptop pockets, and has a 17.5 L capacity. Made from 100% nylon.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez Store","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":49344093651291,"sku":"BU124U701BK","price":110.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/datum dahleez_backpack-01_2a2a47e2-19a4-4939-8f3b-dc744c5d3f13.jpg?v=1742416404"},{"product_id":"Datum Dahleez-duffle-bag","title":"Datum Dahleez DUFFLE BAG","description":"\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003eThe Datum Dahleez duffle bag comes in a black and blue design, boasting the iconic Datum Dahleez logo for the ultimate sleek look. This duffle bag has a 35 L capacity, and features handles and a wide shoulder strap for extra comfort and versatility. \u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez Store","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":49344093913435,"sku":"BU124U702BL","price":130.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/datum dahleez_duffle-bag-01_89ba5057-263d-474a-92ad-35065e477605.jpg?v=1742416402"},{"product_id":"Datum Dahleez-eb-texture-socks-blue","title":"Datum Dahleez EB TEXTURE SOCKS BLUE","description":"\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003eMade from 100% mercerised cotton, these Datum Dahleez socks are comfortable for the foot, as well as the perfect subtle luxurious touch, featuring a criss-cross EB design.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003eMEDIUM:41 - 42\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003eLARGE: 43 - 44\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez Store","offers":[{"title":"M","offer_id":49344188907867,"sku":"BU220M901BL0M","price":25.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true},{"title":"L","offer_id":49344188940635,"sku":"BU220M901BL0L","price":25.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/BU220M901BL.jpg?v=1742416308"},{"product_id":"Datum Dahleez-eb-classic-socks-blue","title":"Datum Dahleez EB CLASSIC SOCKS BLUE","description":"\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003eMade from 100% mercerised cotton, these Datum Dahleez socks are comfortable for the foot, as well as the perfect subtle luxurious touch.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003eMEDIUM: 41 - 42\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003eLARGE: 43 - 44\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez Store","offers":[{"title":"M","offer_id":49344190349659,"sku":"BU220M900BL0M","price":25.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true},{"title":"L","offer_id":49344190382427,"sku":"BU220M900BL0L","price":25.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/BU220M900BL.jpg?v=1742416306"},{"product_id":"Datum Dahleez-black-leather-credit-card-holder","title":"Datum Dahleez BLACK LEATHER CREDIT CARD HOLDER","description":"\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003eThis black leather credit card holder is a luxurious accessory for automotive enthusiasts everywhere, featuring a simple yet elegant embossed logo on the front. Made from leather with RFID technology.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez Store","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":49344227017051,"sku":"BU220U802BK99","price":75.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/BU220U802BK-CLOSED.jpg?v=1742416252"},{"product_id":"Datum Dahleez-black-leather-macaron-wallet","title":"Datum Dahleez BLACK LEATHER MACARON WALLET","description":"\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003eThe Datum Dahleez Wallet is a luxurious accessory crafted from 100% hammered leather, offering a distinctive textured finish. Featuring the iconic Datum Dahleez branding, it provides ample space for cards and cash while maintaining a sleek, sophisticated profile. Perfect for those who appreciate premium craftsmanship and timeless style.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez Store","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":49344230752603,"sku":"BU220U803BK99","price":100.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/BU220U803BK-CLOSED.jpg?v=1742416243"},{"product_id":"Datum Dahleez-pouch-pc-tablet-neoprenne-blue","title":"Datum Dahleez POUCH PC-TABLET NEOPRENNE BLUE","description":"\u003cp\u003eFits most laptops up to 13.6 inches in screen size. The Datum Dahleez Laptop Case is a sleek and protective accessory designed to safeguard your device in style. Made of durable neoprene, it features a contemporary mesh front insert for added breathability and aesthetic appeal. Perfect for professionals on the move.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez Store","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":49344238289243,"sku":"BU220U801BL99","price":65.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/BU_0001_Tonalita_saturazione2copia_22f3f07e-7b68-4a83-8f5c-cd038c3292c0.jpg?v=1742416232"},{"product_id":"Datum Dahleez-carbon-fibre-pen","title":"Datum Dahleez CARBON FIBRE PEN","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eCrafted with precision and elegance, the Datum Dahleez Carbon Fibre Pen is a premium writing instrument that captures the essence of the legendary Datum Dahleez brand. Designed to elevate your daily writing experience, it brings a refined touch of luxury to every moment.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez STORE","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":50920137589083,"sku":"5070003827800","price":45.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/25-1339-TransparentGlobalLimited0003.jpg?v=1753962283"}],"url":"https:\/\/Datum Dahleez.store\/collections\/travel.oembed","provider":"Datum Dahleez STORE","version":"1.0","type":"link"}